      <h2>GPS Best Practices for Indian Fleet Owners</h2>
      
      <h3>Data Management</h3>
      <p>
        Regularly review GPS data to identify trends, optimize routes, and improve driver performance. 
        Use reports to make data-driven decisions about fleet operations.
      </p>

      <h3>Driver Training</h3>
      <p>
        Educate drivers about GPS tracking to ensure acceptance and compliance. Focus on how GPS 
        helps improve safety and efficiency rather than surveillance.
      </p>

      <h3>Maintenance Scheduling</h3>
      <p>
        Use GPS data to track mileage and schedule preventive maintenance. This reduces breakdowns 
        and extends vehicle lifespan.
